              <ui:InvokeCode ContinueOnError="{x:Null}" sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="invoke code c, 품목명으로 파일명 변경" Code="Dim norm As Func(Of String, String) =&#xA;    Function(s As String) If(s, &quot;&quot;).Replace(&quot;-&quot;, &quot;&quot;).Replace(&quot; &quot;, &quot;&quot;).Replace(&quot;_&quot;, &quot;&quot;).Trim().ToUpper()&#xA;&#xA;' 업로드대기 폴더 준비 (이전 실행 결과는 비우고 새로 채움)&#xA;If Not System.IO.Directory.Exists(renameFolder) Then System.IO.Directory.CreateDirectory(renameFolder)&#xA;For Each old As String In System.IO.Directory.GetFiles(renameFolder, &quot;*.pdf&quot;)&#xA;    System.IO.File.Delete(old)&#xA;Next&#xA;&#xA;Dim pilMasks As String() = If(System.IO.Directory.Exists(pilMaskFolder), System.IO.Directory.GetFiles(pilMaskFolder, &quot;*.pdf&quot;), New String() {})&#xA;Dim confMasks As String() = If(System.IO.Directory.Exists(confMaskFolder), System.IO.Directory.GetFiles(confMaskFolder, &quot;*.pdf&quot;), New String() {})&#xA;&#xA;' 진짜 PDF인지 검사 (깨진 파일은 복사하지 않음)&#xA;Dim isPdf As Func(Of String, Boolean) =&#xA;    Function(p As String) As Boolean&#xA;        Dim buf(3) As Byte&#xA;        Using fs As New System.IO.FileStream(p, System.IO.FileMode.Open, System.IO.FileAccess.Read)&#xA;            If fs.Read(buf, 0, 4) &lt; 4 Then Return False&#xA;        End Using&#xA;        Return System.Text.Encoding.ASCII.GetString(buf) = &quot;%PDF&quot;&#xA;    End Function&#xA;&#xA;' 품목번호 이름으로 복사 (같은 이름이 다른 원본으로 이미 있으면 뒤에 구분값 추가)&#xA;Dim used As New Dictionary(Of String, String)(StringComparer.OrdinalIgnoreCase)&#xA;Dim saveAs As Func(Of String, String, String, String) =&#xA;    Function(src As String, baseName As String, suffix As String) As String&#xA;        Dim dest As String = System.IO.Path.Combine(renameFolder, baseName &amp; &quot;.pdf&quot;)&#xA;        If used.ContainsKey(dest) AndAlso used(dest) &lt;&gt; src Then&#xA;            dest = System.IO.Path.Combine(renameFolder, baseName &amp; &quot;_&quot; &amp; suffix &amp; &quot;.pdf&quot;)&#xA;        End If&#xA;        If used.ContainsKey(dest) Then Return &quot;중복행(생략)&quot;&#xA;        If Not isPdf(src) Then Return &quot;마스킹파일 손상&quot;&#xA;        System.IO.File.Copy(src, dest, True)&#xA;        used(dest) = src&#xA;        Return &quot;완료: &quot; &amp; System.IO.Path.GetFileName(dest)&#xA;    End Function&#xA;&#xA;dtRename = New DataTable()&#xA;For Each colName As String In {&quot;품목번호&quot;, &quot;통관번호&quot;, &quot;BL&quot;, &quot;필증_마스킹본&quot;, &quot;필증_결과&quot;, &quot;확인증_마스킹본&quot;, &quot;확인증_결과&quot;}&#xA;    dtRename.Columns.Add(colName)&#xA;Next&#xA;&#xA;For Each r As DataRow In dtTrade.Rows&#xA;    Dim code As String = r(&quot;품목번호&quot;).ToString().Trim()&#xA;    Dim customs As String = r(&quot;통관번호&quot;).ToString().Trim()&#xA;    Dim bl As String = r(&quot;B/L NO&quot;).ToString().Trim()&#xA;    If code = &quot;&quot; Then Continue For&#xA;&#xA;    Try&#xA;        ' --- 수입신고필증 : 통관번호로 마스킹본 찾기 ---&#xA;        Dim customsKey As String = norm(customs)&#xA;        Dim pil As String = pilMasks.Where(Function(f) System.IO.Path.GetFileName(f).ToUpper().StartsWith(&quot;IMP_&quot;) AndAlso norm(System.IO.Path.GetFileName(f)).Contains(customsKey)).OrderByDescending(Function(f) System.IO.File.GetLastWriteTime(f)).FirstOrDefault()&#xA;        Dim pilRes As String = If(customsKey = &quot;&quot; OrElse pil Is Nothing, &quot;마스킹본없음&quot;, saveAs(pil, code &amp; &quot; 수입신고필증&quot;, customsKey))&#xA;&#xA;        ' --- 수입신고확인증 : B/L NO로 마스킹본 찾기 ---&#xA;        Dim blKey As String = norm(bl)&#xA;        Dim confs As List(Of String) = confMasks.Where(Function(f) norm(System.IO.Path.GetFileNameWithoutExtension(f).Split(&quot;_&quot;c).Last()) = blKey).ToList()&#xA;        Dim confRes As String = &quot;마스킹본없음&quot;&#xA;        If blKey &lt;&gt; &quot;&quot; AndAlso confs.Count &gt; 0 Then&#xA;            Dim results As New List(Of String)&#xA;            For Each cf As String In confs&#xA;                results.Add(saveAs(cf, code &amp; &quot; 수입신고확인증&quot;, System.IO.Path.GetFileNameWithoutExtension(cf).Split(&quot;_&quot;c)(0)))&#xA;            Next&#xA;            confRes = String.Join(&quot; / &quot;, results)&#xA;            If confs.Count &gt; 1 Then confRes = &quot;[&quot; &amp; confs.Count.ToString() &amp; &quot;건-확인필요] &quot; &amp; confRes&#xA;        End If&#xA;&#xA;        dtRename.Rows.Add(code, customs, bl,&#xA;                          If(pil Is Nothing, &quot;&quot;, System.IO.Path.GetFileName(pil)), pilRes,&#xA;                          String.Join(&quot; | &quot;, confs.Select(Function(f) System.IO.Path.GetFileName(f))), confRes)&#xA;    Catch ex As Exception&#xA;        dtRename.Rows.Add(code, customs, bl, &quot;&quot;, &quot;오류: &quot; &amp; ex.Message, &quot;&quot;, &quot;&quot;)&#xA;    End Try&#xA;Next" DisplayName="Invoke Code" sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="616,434" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="InvokeCode_5">
